== src/react/Clock.Clock.componentDidMount
EventEntry — React calls componentDidMount after the component is first added to the page
SetMember — set this.timer to setInterval(() => this.tick(), 1000)
== src/react/Clock.Clock.componentWillUnmount
EventEntry — React calls componentWillUnmount right before the component is removed
Call — clearInterval(this.timer)
== src/react/Clock.Clock.tick
Entry — when tick() is called
Call — change state with this.setState({ now: new Date() }) (React renders again)
== src/react/Clock.Clock.render
EventEntry — React calls render every time the component renders
Return — show <time> {this.props.label} {this.state.now.toLocaleTimeString()} </time>
